    21-. "<div>5. Confirms the batch may be<br />released</div><div style='font-size: 70%'>[JSON/HTTPS]</div>" .->20
    20-. "<div>6. Writes the signed batch<br />record</div><div style='font-size: 70%'>[JDBC/SSL]</div>" .->27
    20-. "<div>7. Hands over the production<br />confirmation</div><div style='font-size: 70%'>[JSON/HTTPS]</div>" .->24
